    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 45,
     "y": 128.2,
     "text": "North to Alaska",
     "font": "display",
     "size": 34,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 229.3,
     "tracking": -0.5
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 200.1,
     "text": "Seven days on a ship up the Inside Passage with my sister",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 280.74
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 215.1,
     "text": "Margaret. I stood on the deck every morning in my headscarf",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 302.84
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 230.1,
     "text": "with a cup of tea and watched the forest go by, and saw two",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 290.67
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 245.1,
     "text": "whales, a family of sea otters and something Margaret insists",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 301.97
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 260.1,
     "text": "was a bear.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 54.4
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 282.6,
     "text": "In Juneau we took a little boat out to the glacier, which is blue,",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 309.11
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 297.6,
     "text": "really blue, like the inside of an ice cube.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 199.97
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 330.54,
     "text": "Things we did",
     "font": "heading",
     "size": 14,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 95.21
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 345.6,
     "text": "Read a lot. Ate too much. Found a bakery that does a cinnamon",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 310.96
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 360.6,
     "text": "roll the size of Leo’s head. Sent the children a postcard each,",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 297.06
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 375.6,
     "text": "which will arrive after I do.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 135.9
    }
   ],
